%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6833549e25a74ef47be7767fa7c1da7b, type: 3}
  m_Name: Test Cutscene
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CutsceneData
  cutsceneName: Test Cutscene
  steps:
  - stepType: 0
    speakerName: Old man
    dialogueText: Who goes there? I might be old but I still know how to handle myself!
    actionType: 0
    actionLabel: 
    targetId: 
    moveDistance: 1
    cameraMoveDuration: 1.5
    waitAfterSeconds: 0
  - stepType: 0
    speakerName: Old man
    dialogueText: 'Oh! My gods, Victoria is that you? I''m glad to know you''re alive
      but you truly shouldn''t be here. This city is still dangerous for you. The
      Sangrespina''s have memories as long as their lives.  '
    actionType: 0
    actionLabel: 
    targetId: 
    moveDistance: 1
    cameraMoveDuration: 1.5
    waitAfterSeconds: 0
  - stepType: 0
    speakerName: Victoria
    dialogueText: I'm not the helpless woman I was when you cast me from Segovia,
      Juan. There is no danger here for me. I am the danger.
    actionType: 0
    actionLabel: 
    targetId: 
    moveDistance: 1
    cameraMoveDuration: 1.5
    waitAfterSeconds: 0
  - stepType: 0
    speakerName: Juan
    dialogueText: 'I can see that you joined up with the Espadas Del Sol from the
      looks of it. Have you lost your sense!? If the rumours are true they are almost
      as bad as the Sangrespinas! '
    actionType: 0
    actionLabel: 
    targetId: 
    moveDistance: 1
    cameraMoveDuration: 1.5
    waitAfterSeconds: 0
  - stepType: 0
    speakerName: Victoria
    dialogueText: 'They taught me what I needed to know. I could care less what else
      they do. '
    actionType: 0
    actionLabel: 
    targetId: 
    moveDistance: 1
    cameraMoveDuration: 1.5
    waitAfterSeconds: 0
  - stepType: 0
    speakerName: Juan
    dialogueText: Clearly they did not teach you enough to know that this is suicide.
      How many Espadas have attempted this? Dozens? Hundreds? Yet still the Sangrespinas
      stand untouched. Their estate is crawling with beasts and loyal soldiers alike.
      You'll never even make it past the gate.
    actionType: 0
    actionLabel: 
    targetId: 
    moveDistance: 1
    cameraMoveDuration: 1.5
    waitAfterSeconds: 0
  - stepType: 0
    speakerName: Juan
    dialogueText: Is this really what he would have wanted? For you to throw your
      life away after he saved it? You don't even know if your son's still...
    actionType: 0
    actionLabel: 
    targetId: 
    moveDistance: 1
    cameraMoveDuration: 1.5
    waitAfterSeconds: 0
  - stepType: 0
    speakerName: Victoria
    dialogueText: 'Don''t you dare talk of my son! I know you and my husband did
      what you thought was right, sending me away before they came. But this is what
      you wrought. You won''t deter me in this, Elias will be mine again. No matter
      what he is. '
    actionType: 0
    actionLabel: 
    targetId: 
    moveDistance: 1
    cameraMoveDuration: 1.5
    waitAfterSeconds: 0
  - stepType: 0
    speakerName: Juan
    dialogueText: '*sighs* I can see you believe as much. Your eyes are as solid
      as the steel you wield. Fine, I''ll bring you to Bastion, the Espada Shopkeep
      in town. He''s not well liked but if anybody can get you into that estate it
      is him. '
    actionType: 0
    actionLabel: 
    targetId: 
    moveDistance: 1
    cameraMoveDuration: 1.5
    waitAfterSeconds: 0
  - stepType: 0
    speakerName: Juan
    dialogueText: Bastion! I've... I've brought somebody who's looking to get into
      the Sangrespina estate.
    actionType: 0
    actionLabel: 
    targetId: 
    moveDistance: 1
    cameraMoveDuration: 1.5
    waitAfterSeconds: 0
  - stepType: 0
    speakerName: Bastion
    dialogueText: 'Heh, heh, heh... a fellow Espada eh? You are the first customer
      I''ve had in a very VERY long time. Not many in the market for a slow painful
      death heh heh. '
    actionType: 0
    actionLabel: 
    targetId: 
    moveDistance: 1
    cameraMoveDuration: 1.5
    waitAfterSeconds: 0
  - stepType: 0
    speakerName: Victoria
    dialogueText: 'I''m not looking for death, I''m bringing it with me.  '
    actionType: 0
    actionLabel: 
    targetId: 
    moveDistance: 1
    cameraMoveDuration: 1.5
    waitAfterSeconds: 0
  - stepType: 0
    speakerName: Bastion
    dialogueText: Ho ho! You've brought me a lively one Juan! Let me be very clear
      with you missy, it doesn't matter what you intend, how angry you are or how
      good you are with that blade. Only one thing matters around these parts, what
      that family wants. They are an absolute. And if you go knocking on their door
      thinking otherwise you're in for a world of hurt.
    actionType: 0
    actionLabel: 
    targetId: 
    moveDistance: 1
    cameraMoveDuration: 1.5
    waitAfterSeconds: 0
  - stepType: 0
    speakerName: Victoria
    dialogueText: I mean for God's sake you're only a Four Teether! You're telling
      me you, of all people, basically a babe fresh from the arms of its mother,
      are going to kill not just the strongest Vampire in the entire known world
      but his entire damn family!?
    actionType: 0
    actionLabel: 
    targetId: 
    moveDistance: 1
    cameraMoveDuration: 1.5
    waitAfterSeconds: 0
  - stepType: 0
    speakerName: Victoria
    dialogueText: Are you done with the lecture? Just because you clearly couldn't
      cut it against them doesn't mean the rest of us are plagued by the same incompetence.
      Show me how I can get into that Estate. After that you can wash your hands
      of me.
    actionType: 0
    actionLabel: 
    targetId: 
    moveDistance: 1
    cameraMoveDuration: 1.5
    waitAfterSeconds: 0
  - stepType: 0
    speakerName: Bastion
    dialogueText: Alright, alright. I'll show you the way in. You'll have to navigate
      the sewers before you can get to the main estate but it is the easiest route.
      No need to pay for the info though, I can just rifle through your corpse's
      pockets later anyways heh heh!
    actionType: 0
    actionLabel: 
    targetId: 
    moveDistance: 1
    cameraMoveDuration: 1.5
    waitAfterSeconds: 0
  - stepType: 0
    speakerName: Victoria
    dialogueText: Lead the way.
    actionType: 0
    actionLabel: 
    targetId: 
    moveDistance: 1
    cameraMoveDuration: 1.5
    waitAfterSeconds: 0
